#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client so you can run jobs with IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Installa il client IBM Quantum Compute per poter eseguire job con IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client"
msgstr "Installa il client IBM Quantum Compute"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"
msgstr "Installa il client IBM Quantum Compute {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service è il servizio cloud per l'esecuzione di calcoli quantistici sull'hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. Questa guida ti mostra come installare `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, il pacchetto client per accedere a IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "Prima di installare `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, segui le istruzioni in queste guide:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Installa Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configura il tuo account IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr "Esegui questo comando per installare il client IBM Quantum Compute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Resta aggiornato con le ultime versioni\">\n"
"Controlla periodicamente le [note di rilascio di `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) per vedere le nuove versioni. Ti consigliamo di aggiornare frequentemente i requisiti per `qiskit-ibm-runtime` eseguendo `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Passi successivi {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"  - [Installa Qiskit SDK dal codice sorgente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Esegui il tuo primo programma](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prova un tutorial, come l'[algoritmo di Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Consulta la [politica di deprecazione](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
